            <ArticleTitle>Extended-release hydrocodone (Hysingla ER) for pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>71-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Hysingla ER, the second single-ingredient extended-release hydrocodone product to become available in the US, is formulated for once-daily use. Zohydro ER is dosed twice daily and costs more. Both Hysingla ER and the new formulation of Zohydro ER have abuse-deterrent properties, but they will still be subject to misuse.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
